 r←exportArrow(con sql path);rows;errptr;st;msg
⍝ Export a SQL query result to an Arrow IPC stream file (.arrows).
⍝ con: duckdb connection handle
⍝ sql: SQL string (typically SELECT)
⍝ path: output file path
⍝ r: row count written
⍝ Uses libduckdb_arrow_ipc (see scripts/build-arrow-export-shim.sh).
 rows←0
 errptr←0
 st←api.duckdb_export_query_arrow_ipc con sql path rows errptr
 :If st≠DuckDBSuccess
     :If errptr≠0
         msg←1024 read.utf8 errptr
         {}api.duckdb_free errptr
     :Else
         msg←'Arrow export failed'
     :EndIf
     ⎕SIGNAL msg
 :EndIf
 r←rows
